# managed by .agents/scripts/install-search-ignores.py -- re-run it after adding a project, edit the script not this file.
# Read by ripgrep, which is what the agent Grep and Glob tools run on. Does not touch git and
# does not touch skill loading (Claude Code and find-local-skill.py walk directories directly).
# Escape hatch for one search: rg --no-ignore <pattern>

# Mirrored skill trees. `.claude/skills` deliberately stays searchable as the canonical copy.
.agents/skills/
.cursor/skills/
.codex/skills/
/skills/
.skill-backup-*/

# Third-party code: not ours, never edited, answers to searches meant for our own code.
repos/
**/repos/
**/dbt_packages/
**/site-packages/
.venv*/
**/.venv*/
node_modules/

# Frozen or superseded copies.
**/archive/
**/archives/
**/legacy-workspaces/
**/.agents copy/

# Backups and build droppings that read as live code in a hit list.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
*.backup-*
*.before-*
*.partial-*
*.orig
*.rej
*-shm
*-wal

# Run logs and caches: high volume, zero reuse.
*.log
*.log.[0-9]*
**/output/
**/.next/
**/.wrangler/
